  "steps": [
    "Wash rice in the rice cooker inner pot and fill with the required water.",
    "Lightly thaw frozen sausages in the microwave, place them on top of the rice and water in the cooker, and start the rice cooking cycle.",
    "Shortly before the rice finishes, melt butter in a frying pan and make a fried egg.",
    "Once the rice is done cooking, open the cooker and slice the sausages into bite-sized pieces using scissors.",
    "Cut about a handful of scallions directly into the rice cooker using scissors.",
    "Add soy sauce, sesame oil, and sesame seeds to taste, then mix everything together thoroughly.",
    "Transfer the mixed rice to a serving bowl, top with the fried egg and crushed seaweed flakes, and serve (optionally with kimchi)."
  ]
